  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Casting Investment Study India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based in Delft, Perla AluCast (Perla) has been supplying aluminium castings to a broad network of European customers since 1994. Perla produces high-quality casting at competitive prices. Because Perla is active in its foundries in India and China, the chain is very short. Perla is closely involved in and is responsible for the production of clients&apos; products in its foundries, which means Perla doesn&apos;t just passes on clients&apos; orders to third parties.A partnership with Perla AluCast, in addition to the significant cost savings that clients enjoy, also means greater reliability and the error-free and punctual delivery of clients&apos; aluminium castings.The purpose of the investment preparation study is to investigate whether it is technically and commercially feasible for Perla AluCast to set up a joint venture with Unique Shell Mold in aluminum casting.</narrative>
  </description>
